        "content": "## SNIPE-IT endpoints activos\n**Categorias:**\n`POST: http://<snipe-host>/api/v1/categories`\n**Estados:**\n`POST: http://<snipe-host>/api/v1/statuslabels`\n`PATCH: http://<snipe-host>/api/v1/statuslabels/<:status_id>`\n**Modelos**\n`POST: http://<snipe-host>/api/v1/models`\n`PATCH: http://<snipe-host>/api/v1/models/<:model_id>`\n**Activos**\n`POST: http://<snipe-host>/api/v1/hardware`\n`PATCH: http://<snipe-host>/api/v1/hardware/<:asset_id>`",
